OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit crematorium's reopening
OL,4,Adelayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crematorium damaged in a fire will
OL,7,Fremain shut for longer than first
OL,8,Fclaimed as repair work continues.
OL,10,FThorncliffe Crematorium in Barrow,
OL,11,FCumbria, closed at the end of June for
OL,12,Fthe roof and chimneys to be replaced
OL,13,Ffollowing the blaze.
OL,15,FWestmorland and Furness Council, which
OL,16,Foperates the facility, initially said
OL,17,Fthe work would take six to eight weeks
OL,18,Fto complete.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
