OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit crematorium's reopening
OL,4,Adelayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a new update, the authority said an
OL,7,Fopening date was yet to be confirmed
OL,8,Fbut it was anticipated to be around
OL,9,Flate September before services could
OL,10,Fresume.
